# User-build Tests

User-build tests are designed to run in userbuild targets

Note: The infrastructure does not support executing these tests in CI/CD yet
so the tests in this folder are being used to facilitate that setup. Once fully supported, the organization of the folder will match the structure of the other types tests in this repository to scope ownership per component.
